  "critique": {
    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong, cohesive defense-console aesthetic: restrained cyan/green/yellow accents, crisp borders, clear headline dominance, and consistent precedent rows. Desktop is polished, but the detached results callout leaves an awkwardly empty center. Tablet becomes vertically loose, while mobile is excessively long and several mono labels/supporting lines are extremely small and low-contrast. The global header also degrades into a clipped horizontal rail on tablet/mobile, with incomplete contrast evidence for its muted links.",
